                    ]
                  }
                },
                { "kind": "text", "html": "<p>Two things the design asks for aren’t there yet: <strong>Pricing</strong> leaves out fees other than interest (R-c9h), and <strong>Offers</strong> marks the first of two equal totals (R-k3f). So building this design would change three parts:</p>" },
